  itemDescription: "Smart Cities Institute  Reconstructing 3D Models  This institute
    works on technologies for smart cities and urban innovation. Its mission is to
    develop and integrate smart city solutions including urban IoT, intelligent transportation
    systems, smart grids, and e-government services. Focus areas: city data platforms
    and AI analytics for urban management, smart mobility (traffic optimization,
    autonomous public transport), energy-efficient buildings and infrastructure,
    and citizen engagement tech (open data, smart kiosks). The institute partners
    with city authorities (e.g. Riyadh, NEOM) to pilot these solutions and create
    reference models for connected, sustainable cities. Ultimately, it aims to improve
    urban quality of life and city operations efficiency through technology, aligning
    with the Kingdom\u2019s vision for modern, tech-driven cities"
